  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WAKE_THE_HILL_CLANS": "Wake the Hill Clans",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WAKE_THE_HILL_CLANS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once: the Hill Clans, giants, are born as your vassal in two cities on hills of unowned land (each with a Palisade), with four Hill Giants.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Their hero: Thrumm the Mountain-King (large, HP 200, attack 100, defence 100).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]They alone train Hill Giants (large, HP 180, attack 70, 90 hammers).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+1 production on each of their plots on hills.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Needs a free hill site with 6 or more unowned hill or peak plots within 3 plots, and a second free hill site among them.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WAKE_THE_HILL_CLANS_PEDIA": "The giants sleep under the hills, the old songs say, and wake for whoever knows how to knock.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Expert: wake them early on the hills between you and your nearest rival: a wall of giants that fights for you.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WAKE_THE_HILL_CLANS": "Wake the Hill Clans",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_WAKE_THE_HILL_CLANS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]The Hill Clans are born as your vassal in two cities on hills of unowned land, the hills nearest your capital with 6 or more hill or peak plots within 3 plots.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Each city has a Palisade and two Hill Giants; Thrumm the Mountain-King in the first.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Once per game.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_PALACE_HILL_CLANS": "Palace",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_CLAN_GIANT_STRATEGY": "The Hill Clans' own unit: large, HP 180, attack 70, defence 70, for 90 hammers.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_THRUMM": "Thrumm the Mountain-King",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_THRUMM_PEDIA": "Thrumm is the oldest of the giants under the hills, and the largest. When he walks, the clans walk behind him.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_THRUMM_STRATEGY": "A hero above its era: large, HP 200, attack 100, defence 100.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_HILL_CLANS_DESC": "The Hill Clans",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_HILL_CLANS_SHORT_DESC": "Hill Clans",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_HILL_CLANS_ADJECTIVE": "Giant",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_HILL_CLANS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]It alone trains Hill Giants (large, HP 180, attack 70, 90 hammers).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+1 production on each of its plots on hills.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Hero: Thrumm the Mountain-King.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_HILL_CLANS_PEDIA": "The Hill Clans are the giants of the old hills: few, slow and very strong, with their halls cut into the stone.",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_1": "Thrummhall",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_2": "Stonebrow",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_3": "Cragmoot",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_4": "Boulderhold",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_5": "Highcairn",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_6": "Greyfell",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_7": "Ironknap",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_HILL_CLANS_8": "Tor Ghall",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_THRUMM": "Thrumm",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_THRUMM_PEDIA": "Thrumm the Mountain-King slept a thousand years and woke hungry. He has decided to be patient about it."
  }
}
